  <product_name>11 Speed Bonded HollowtechⅡ Road Cranksets</product_name>
  <product_desc>Brand name: DURA-ACE, ULTEGRA, Certification number: 해당사항 없음</product_desc>
  <product_code>
    <publication>2024-05-01</publication>
    <brick>10008269</brick>
  </product_code>
  <product_model_no>FC-9000, FC-R9100, FC-R9100P, FC-6800, FC-R8000</product_model_no>
  <hazard>The bicycle drivetrain operates by pedaling, which rotates the chainring attached to the crank, thereby propelling the rear wheel via the chain. The crank arm is the component connecting the pedal to the crank spindle. If the bonded layers of the crank arm separate during bicycle operation, this can cause gaps and offsets, potentially leading to falls.
Falls during bicycle rides may result in bruises, fractures, and other injuries.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>If your product is affected, you can receive a free inspection at designated retail points. 
 As of November 8, 2023, there are 99 designated retail points, and we will appoint additional shops capable of inspection and replacement in areas lacking direct brand stores and designated retail points. 
 Please refer to the Shimano website''s notice section for the inspection dealer list (https://bike.shimano.com/ko-KR/information/customer-services/corrective-actions/important-safety-notice-11-speed-hollowtech-road-cranksets-inspection-program.html) 
 If replacement parts are available at the distributor logistics center, dispatch may take 1-2 days after inspection (more time may be needed if stock is low). 
 Product replacement takes approximately 30 minutes.</action>
  <units></units>
  <URL>http://www.safetykorea.kr/recall/ajax/recallBoard?recallUid=10019666</URL>
