  <product_type>Household goods  ;  Other Household Goods ; Gas Lighter</product_type>
  <product_name>Gas Lighter</product_name>
  <product_desc>Brand name: Bulmoa, Certification number: A051R002-20001</product_desc>
  <product_code>
    <publication>2024-05-01</publication>
    <brick>10000543</brick>
  </product_code>
  <product_model_no>KBJ-JA</product_model_no>
  <hazard>Although there is no product defect on which the left flame is (-) and the right flame is (+), the brand name engraving on the cap of the ''Bulmoa'' product in the KBJ-JA model is displayed in reverse, indicating the small flame as (+) and the large one as (-), causing confusion and potential hazard. Adjustable lighters should have directions indicating where to produce high or low flames on the product.
There is a risk of burns from erroneously perceiving the flame size in reverse.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>- Exchange and repair recall methods Consumers with the ''Bulmoa'' brand name on the KBJ-JA model should immediately stop using the product and contact the manufacturer for an exchange with a new product. Contact: 031-985-8003</action>
  <units></units>
  <URL>http://www.safetykorea.kr/recall/ajax/recallBoard?recallUid=10021477</URL>
