  <product_model_no>Scandic U-Shaped 3-Sided Bumper Guard</product_model_no>
  <hazard>- The product, Scandic U-Shaped 3-Sided Bumper Guard children''s textile product, exceeded the common safety standard limit for hazardous element content in children''s products (Standard limit: 100 mg/kg or less)
 - Total lead of 630 mg/kg detected in the metal zipper handle of the bumper guard lining
 - Total lead of 529 mg/kg detected in the metal zipper body of the bumper guard lining
- Exposure to lead can cause dermatitis, keratopathy, and central nervous system disorders</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>- Contact the inquiry point for repair, exchange, refund, or other actions
- Consumers who own this product should immediately cease use</action>
  <units></units>
