  - Total lead detected at 125 mg/kg in the metal zipper handle of the bumper guard lining
  - Detected 1.25 times the standard limit
○ Exposure to lead can cause dermatitis, keratitis, and central nervous disorders</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>○ Contact the inquiry center for exchange through calls or visits
○ Consumers who own this product should immediately stop using it
