  <product_model_no>PB2030MI</product_model_no>
  <hazard>-Due to a potential quality issue with raw materials supplied by one of our suppliers, specific models (Model: PB2030MI) manufactured between August and September 2024 may malfunction under certain usage conditions. While an investigation with the supplier is ongoing, Xiaomi is committed to providing safe, reliable, and high-quality products to users worldwide. Therefore, in line with Xiaomi''s commitment to product safety, we are announcing a proactive recall.
 -Some units of the Xiaomi 33W Portable Charger 20000mAh (Integrated Cable) (Model: PB2030MI) manufactured between August and September 2024 may experience malfunction under specific usage scenarios, leading to battery overheating and potentially posing a fire hazard.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>-Consumers can visit an offline Xiaomi service center or access the official website (https://www.mi.com/kr/support/safety-notice/) to enter their SN code to check if their product is subject to recall and request a return and refund. 
 -The SN codes for the affected products (products subject to recall) are 59592/D3AEVA4XV00422, 59592/D3AEVA4XV00499, 59592/D3AEVA4XV01238.</action>
  <units></units>
  <URL>http://www.safetykorea.kr/recall/ajax/recallBoard?recallUid=10021490</URL>
