  <product_model_no>YONEX JR 25 / YONEX JR 23 / YONEX JR 21 / KYRGIOS JR 25 / KYRGIOS JR 23 / KYRGIOS JR 21</product_model_no>
  <hazard> -The end cap portion of the racket (green plastic) was found to contain phthalates exceeding the standard limit (total content 0.1% or less) by approximately 170 times, with a detected amount of 17.39%.

  1. Exposure to infants can disrupt the endocrine system, affecting growth, development, and reproductive functions. 
  2. Skin contact may cause allergic dermatitis or irritation.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action> - Consumers who possess the affected product should immediately discontinue use and dispose of it. 
    - Please complete the refund application form on the official Yonex Korea online website (Yonex Mall) to receive a refund or exchange.</action>
  <units></units>
