  <hazard>- Total cadmium content exceeded the standard limit by 1.9 times
  - Part: Film Transparent MIX (Surface of Label Sticker)
  - Measured value: 145 mg/kg
  - Standard limit: 75 mg/kg or less

- Phthalate plasticizers exceeded standard limits by ① 113.8 times, ② 106.9 times, ③ 69.7 times
  - Part: ① Film Transparent MIX (Surface of Lever Caution Sticker), ② Film Transparent MIX (Surface of Label Sticker), ③ Film Transparent MIX (Manufacture Date Sticker)
  - Measured value: ① DEHP 11.113 %, DINP 0.268 %, ② DEHP 10.699 %, ③ DEHP 6.970 %
