  <hazard>ㅇ Inadequate cords and drawstrings 
- Parts: ① Toggle loop, ② Fixed loop, ③ Flat loop
- Measured values: ① Toggle is used on the loop, ② Fixed loop: 27.0 cm, 27.0 cm, 28.0 cm, 28.0 cm, ③ Flat loop: 8.3 cm, 8.5 cm
- Standard limit: ① 3.1.2 Toggles may only be used on drawstrings or decorative cords without free ends. ②&③ 3.1.4 Fixed loops such as drawn-out loops or fixed bows for fastening garments must have a circumference of 7.5 cm or less. Flat loops that do not protrude from the garment like belt loops must have a length between the points of attachment to the garment of 7.5 cm or less. 
ㅇ Nonylphenol standard exceeded by 1.4 times
- Part: Gray outer fabric
- Measured value: NPEO 148.1 mg/kg
- Standard limit: Total 100 mg/kg or less

ㅇ Potential for accidents due to entrapment, entanglement of cords and drawstrings. 
ㅇ May cause reproductive development disorders if exposed to nonylphenol.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>ㅇ Consumers possessing this product should immediately cease use. 
ㅇ Contact or visit the inquiry point for repair, exchange, refund, or other corrective actions.</action>
