  <product_model_no>M18 FTHCHS35</product_model_no>
  <hazard>We have identified that some products may have foreign substances clogging certain components, potentially preventing the brake from functioning properly when excessively used by users.
If the brake does not function properly, the chain may come into contact with the user, leading to laceration hazards. These laceration hazards can result in minor injuries that do not require special treatment, but in some cases, injuries that require treatment may occur.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>1. Check the serial number on the product or gift box sticker to see if it contains an ''A'' in the middle.
2. If an ''A'' is found in the middle of the serial number, immediately stop using the product.
3. Contact our service center to receive guidance on free collection and repair for the affected product.
* Milwaukee Customer Center: 02-1644-4009</action>
