  <product_model_no>90 Quart Flip & Tow Rolling Coolers</product_model_no>
  <hazard>Due to the towing handle, consumers'' fingertips may get pinched by the cooler.

If fingertips are pinched by the cooler due to the towing handle, there is a risk of laceration or crushing of the fingertips.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>Consumers should immediately stop using the affected products and participate in the safety program by visiting the webpage (http://www.igloo90qtrecall.expertinquiry.com) to complete registration for a handle replacement kit.

The towing handle replacement kit will be shipped free of charge, and it includes all necessary instructions for the handle replacement.

- Contact: Igloo Product Corp.
- +44 20 8834 9597 or, http://www.igloo90qtrecall.expertinquiry.com</action>
