  <hazard>- Non-compliance with cord and drawstring standards 
- Part: Ankle string 
- Measured value: Not adequately attached to clothing, as it lacks bartacking at least one point equidistant from the exit point. 
- Standard limit: If drawstrings are used, they must be attached to the garment with bartacking at least at one point equidistant from the exit point as per standard 3.1.3.

