  <product_model_no>(Product No.) C51KN001 / (Product Name) Have Stripe Knit Cardigan</product_model_no>
  <hazard>1. Total lead content exceeded the standard limit by 378.8 times
- Part: Yellow Coating on Zipper Body/Seam/Handle
- Measured value: 34,099.5 mg/kg
- Standard limit: 90 mg/kg or less
2. Non-compliance of cords and drawstrings
- Part: Drawstring
- Measured value: ① Not attached to the garment as there is no bartack at one or more points equidistant from the exit point.
② Free ends on drawstrings exist.
- Standard limit: ① When drawstrings are used, bartacks must be done at one or more points equidistant from the exit point to attach to the garment.
② Free ends should not be present on drawstrings.
3. Insufficient labeling
- Missing age information
1. Exposure to lead may cause dermatitis, keratitis, central nervous disorders, etc.
2. Possibility of accidents due to entrapment, entanglement of cords and drawstrings
3. Concern over providing incorrect information</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>1. Consumers who own this product should immediately cease use
2. Contact the inquiry point to receive repair, exchange, refund, etc.</action>
