  <product_model_no>ARC 1100, 1400, 1600 DICUT 50 / 55 / 65 , ARC 1600 SPLINE 50 / 55 / 65 , ERC 1100, 1400, 1600 DICUT 35 / 45  , ERC 1600 SPLINE 35 / 45 , ERC LOG CLASSIC 45 , CRC 1100 DICUT 45 , CRC 1400, 1600 SPLINE 35 / 45  , HEC 1400 SPLINE 45</product_model_no>
  <hazard>Delamination of the rim flange area significantly reduces the structural strength of the rim and may lead to complete rim failure, resulting in serious injury or death. 
To date, no accidents or failures have been reported domestically.</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>Consumers owning the affected wheelsets should immediately stop using them and, following the procedures below, have them exchanged for new products.

1. Check with your DT Swiss ID, enter personal information, and confirm receipt number via email.

2. Visit the MBS official service center with the receipt number to proceed with registration.

3. MBS Corporation will conduct an individual inspection of the wheelsets.

4. If no issues are found, you will be informed of the return date for the wheelsets.

5. If problems are identified, a free replacement will be provided.</action>
