  <hazard>- Non-compliance of cords and drawstrings
- Part: Hood drawstring
- Measured value: Not bar tacked
- Standard limit: When drawstrings are used, at least one bar tacking (stitching) must be applied at the midpoint from the exit point and attached to the garment
- Inadequate labeling
- Omission of fiber composition or blend ratio, manufacturer''s name or importer''s name, labeler''s address and phone number, usage age
- Possibility of accidents due to entrapment or entanglement of cords and drawstrings
- Risk of providing incorrect information exists</hazard>
  <injuries>No injury has been reported</injuries>
  <action>- Consumers possessing the product should immediately cease usage.
- Contact or visit the inquiry point for repair, exchange, or refund.</action>
